[{"client_msg_id":"bfd1ee37-72d1-4af7-a01e-a28b202b9eb3","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"\u0026gt; 9:51 PM PDT Between 3:30 PM and 9:42 PM PDT we experienced elevated packet loss for customers connecting to AWS services within AP-NORTHEAST-1 Region through their Direct Connect connections. This was caused by the loss of several core networking devices that are used to connect Direct Connect network traffic to all Availability Zones in the AP-NORTHEAST-1 Region. The issue has been resolved and the service is operating normally.\n復旧報きたー","ts":"1630558931.013900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":4,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U9S4G0LJW","UDPT2BZ6E","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5IE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9dfca4e-72c9-48a6-b610-d5cd655f2f5c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"囲い込みって、サービス側、利用側どちらにもその気がなくてもなりますからね...","ts":"1630558757.013600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GMT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"174e612e-4617-4121-b020-51f2f2aff5ae","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"一度基盤乗っけちゃうと引越しとかしたくないから余計に","ts":"1630558732.013100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R1A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78d15e57-854b-479b-9072-6917f3aa3214","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"よくよく考えたらベンダ依存された方が儲かるしAmazonが自身をSPOFとなるように誘導しているという見方も","ts":"1630558698.012400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0ldG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d0b98fa-9e95-4b4b-9aec-9e71f89da85f","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"今回みたいにAWS内の特定サービスのみとかならなんとかなるんですけどね…\nIaaS全体にとか波及した場合はきっつい","ts":"1630558696.012300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nie"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1d586f1-a3d4-4a60-8179